OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy in the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith rain spreading southwards and
OL,8,Fbecoming heavy at times. Strong winds
OL,9,Fthrough the evening but easing
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FRain may be heavy at times
OL,13,Fin the morning as it clears to the
OL,14,Fsouth. Increasingly bright spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping during the afternoon with
OL,16,Fthe odd shower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
